---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { contact } from '../content/site';
---

<Legal title="Privacy policy">
  <p class="draft">
    Placeholder — the full Datenschutzerklärung must be written and legally reviewed before this site goes live.
  </p>
  <p>Points the final policy will need to cover (for the reviewer):</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Controller name and address, and contact: {contact.email}</li>
    <li>What the enquiry form collects (name, email, goal, optional message), the purpose (replying to the enquiry) and the legal basis</li>
    <li>Which form service or email provider processes submissions, and any data-processing agreement</li>
    <li>Hosting provider and server logs</li>
    <li>How long enquiries are kept and how to request deletion</li>
    <li>Visitor rights under the GDPR and the right to complain to a supervisory authority</li>
    <li>Fonts are self-hosted; the site sets no cookies and uses no analytics or tracking at present</li>
  </ul>
</Legal>
